                    Tooltip = 'How to move when there is no target to shoot. Off stays in place. Random scatters you far away, Translocate drops you onto an out-of-bounds part, Projectile Breaker hides behind cover, Void Spam teleports you into the deep void.',
                })
                RagebotGroup:AddDropdown('P8S4_RageMethod', {
